          "settings": {
            "tag": "Studied in people",
            "title": "Precursors raise NAD+ in people.",
            "text": "In randomized, placebo-controlled trials, healthy adults who took NAD+ precursors had higher NAD+ levels in their blood than those who took a placebo. These studies tested NMN and NR, not NAD+ taken directly.",
